[meta]
lang: en
title: OireMark conformance tests: Nesting Rules
[/meta]

h1. Nesting Rules

Tests for Section 21 of the specification.

h2. Allowed

h3. Note inside an expandable block, list inside the note {#nesting-more-note-list}
[code om]
[more Outer]
[note]
* Item
[/note]
[/more]
[/code]
[code html]
<details>
<summary>Outer</summary>
<div role="note" class="note">
<ul>
<li>Item</li>
</ul>
</div>
</details>
[/code]

h3. Code inside a long definition {#nesting-def-code}
```om
[def Term]
[code]
x
[/code]
[/def]
```
[code html]
<dl>
<dt>Term</dt>
<dd>
<pre><code>x
</code></pre>
</dd>
</dl>
[/code]

h3. Lists inside a long definition {#nesting-def-list}
[code om]
[def Term]
* One
* Two
[/def]
[/code]
[code html]
<dl>
<dt>Term</dt>
<dd>
<ul>
<li>One</li>
<li>Two</li>
</ul>
</dd>
</dl>
[/code]

h3. Block language section with a heading, a note and a nested section {#nesting-lang-block}
[code om]
[lang fr]
h2. Bonjour

[note]
Texte.
[/note]

[lang de]
Hallo.
[/lang]
[/lang]
[/code]
[code html]
<div lang="fr">
<h2 id="bonjour">Bonjour</h2>
<div role="note" class="note">
<p>Texte.</p>
</div>
<div lang="de">
<p>Hallo.</p>
</div>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Footnote block inside a block language section {#nesting-lang-fn}
[code om]
[lang fr]
[fn]
1. Note.
[/fn]
[/lang]
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-nesting 2
[/code]

h3. Empty quote {#nesting-empty-quote}
[code om]
[quote]
[/quote]
[/code]
[code html]
<blockquote></blockquote>
[/code]

h2. Not Allowed

h3. Note inside a quote {#nesting-quote-note}
[code om]
[quote]
[note]
Text.
[/note]
[/quote]
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-nesting 2
[/code]

h3. Quote inside a note {#nesting-note-quote}
[code om]
[note]
[quote]
Text.
[/quote]
[/note]
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-nesting 2
[/code]

h3. Expandable block inside a quote {#nesting-quote-more}
[code om]
[quote]
[more Title]
Text.
[/more]
[/quote]
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-nesting 2
[/code]

h3. Short form quote inside a bracket quote {#nesting-quote-short-quote}
[code om]
[quote]
> Inner.
[/quote]
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-nesting 2
[/code]

h3. Heading inside a long definition {#nesting-def-heading}
[code om]
[def Term]
h2. Heading
[/def]
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-nesting 2
[/code]

h3. Definition inside a long definition {#nesting-def-def}
[code om]
[def Outer]
[def Inner]
Text.
[/def]
[/def]
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-nesting 2
[/code]

h3. Table inside a quote {#nesting-quote-table}
[code om]
[quote]
Text.
| a | b |
[/quote]
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-nesting 3
[/code]

h3. Heading inside a note {#nesting-note-heading}
[code om]
[note]
h2. Heading
[/note]
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-nesting 2
[/code]

h3. Block tag inside a table cell {#nesting-table-cell-block}
[code om]
| [note] |
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 1
[/code]

h2. Nesting depth

h3. Sixteen nested containers are allowed {#nesting-depth-16-containers}
[code om]
[more Level 1]
[more Level 2]
[more Level 3]
[more Level 4]
[more Level 5]
[more Level 6]
[more Level 7]
[more Level 8]
[more Level 9]
[more Level 10]
[more Level 11]
[more Level 12]
[more Level 13]
[more Level 14]
[more Level 15]
[more Level 16]
Deep.
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/code]
[code html]
<details><summary>Level 1</summary>
<details><summary>Level 2</summary>
<details><summary>Level 3</summary>
<details><summary>Level 4</summary>
<details><summary>Level 5</summary>
<details><summary>Level 6</summary>
<details><summary>Level 7</summary>
<details><summary>Level 8</summary>
<details><summary>Level 9</summary>
<details><summary>Level 10</summary>
<details><summary>Level 11</summary>
<details><summary>Level 12</summary>
<details><summary>Level 13</summary>
<details><summary>Level 14</summary>
<details><summary>Level 15</summary>
<details><summary>Level 16</summary>
<p>Deep.</p>
</details>
</details>
</details>
</details>
</details>
</details>
</details>
</details>
</details>
</details>
</details>
</details>
</details>
</details>
</details>
</details>
[/code]

h3. A seventeenth container is an error {#nesting-depth-17-containers}
[code om]
[more Level 1]
[more Level 2]
[more Level 3]
[more Level 4]
[more Level 5]
[more Level 6]
[more Level 7]
[more Level 8]
[more Level 9]
[more Level 10]
[more Level 11]
[more Level 12]
[more Level 13]
[more Level 14]
[more Level 15]
[more Level 16]
[more Level 17]
Too deep.
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/code]
[code error]
nesting-too-deep 17
[/code]

h3. Sixteen list levels are allowed {#nesting-depth-16-list-levels}
[code om]
* Level 1
** Level 2
*** Level 3
**** Level 4
***** Level 5
****** Level 6
******* Level 7
******** Level 8
********* Level 9
********** Level 10
*********** Level 11
************ Level 12
************* Level 13
************** Level 14
*************** Level 15
**************** Level 16
[/code]
[code html]
<ul><li>Level 1
<ul><li>Level 2
<ul><li>Level 3
<ul><li>Level 4
<ul><li>Level 5
<ul><li>Level 6
<ul><li>Level 7
<ul><li>Level 8
<ul><li>Level 9
<ul><li>Level 10
<ul><li>Level 11
<ul><li>Level 12
<ul><li>Level 13
<ul><li>Level 14
<ul><li>Level 15
<ul><li>Level 16
</li></ul>
</li></ul>
</li></ul>
</li></ul>
</li></ul>
</li></ul>
</li></ul>
</li></ul>
</li></ul>
</li></ul>
</li></ul>
