</li></ul>
</li></ul>
</li></ul>
</li></ul>
[/code]

h3. A seventeenth list level is an error {#nesting-depth-17-list-levels}
[code om]
* Level 1
** Level 2
*** Level 3
**** Level 4
***** Level 5
****** Level 6
******* Level 7
******** Level 8
********* Level 9
********** Level 10
*********** Level 11
************ Level 12
************* Level 13
************** Level 14
*************** Level 15
**************** Level 16
***************** Level 17
[/code]
[code error]
nesting-too-deep 17
[/code]

h3. Containers and list levels count together {#nesting-depth-mixed}
Fifteen containers plus a list makes 16; the nested list item would be the 17th level.
[code om]
[more Level 1]
[more Level 2]
[more Level 3]
[more Level 4]
[more Level 5]
[more Level 6]
[more Level 7]
[more Level 8]
[more Level 9]
[more Level 10]
[more Level 11]
[more Level 12]
[more Level 13]
[more Level 14]
[more Level 15]
* Level 16
** Level 17
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/more]
[/code]
[code error]
nesting-too-deep 17
[/code]
